[
  {
    "content_id": "10065001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是耶稣基督的奴仆、雅各的兄弟犹大，现在写信给蒙父上帝呼召和眷爱、并被耶稣基督看顾的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;愿你们饱得怜悯、平安和慈爱！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄姊妹，我一直迫切地想写信跟你们谈谈我们所共享的救恩，但现在我觉得有必要写信劝勉你们竭力护卫一次就完整地交给圣徒的真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因为有些不敬虔的人偷偷地混进你们中间，以上帝的恩典作借口放纵情欲，否认独一的主宰——我们的主耶稣基督。圣经上早已记载，这样的人必受到审判。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;以下的事情，你们虽然都知道，但我还要再提醒你们：从前上帝把祂的子民从埃及救出来，后来把其中不信的人灭绝了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;至于不守本分、擅离领地的天使，上帝也用锁链将他们永远囚禁在幽暗里，等候最后审判的大日子到来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;此外，所多玛、蛾摩拉及其附近城镇的人同样因为荒淫无度、沉溺于变态的情欲而遭到永远不灭之火的刑罚。这些事都成为我们的警戒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;同样，这些做梦的人玷污自己的身体，不服权柄，毁谤有尊荣的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;当天使长米迦勒为摩西的尸体跟魔鬼争辩的时候，尚且不敢用毁谤的话谴责它，只说：“愿主责罚你！”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;但这些人对自己不懂的事也随口毁谤，好像没有理性的牲畜一样凭本能行事，结果自取灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他们有祸了！他们步了该隐的后尘，为牟利而重蹈巴兰的谬误，又像可拉一样因叛逆而灭亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;这些人在你们的爱宴中是败类。他们肆无忌惮地吃喝，是只顾喂养自己的牧人；是没有雨的云，随风飘荡；是深秋不结果子的树，被连根拔起，彻底枯死；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;是海中的狂涛，翻动着自己可耻的泡沫；是流荡的星星，有幽幽黑暗永远留给他们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;亚当的第七代子孙以诺曾经针对这些人说预言：“看啊！主率领祂千万的圣者一同降临，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;要审判所有的人，按不虔不敬的罪人所行的一切不虔不敬之事和他们亵渎上帝的话定他们的罪。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;这些人满腹牢骚，怨天尤人，放纵自己的邪情私欲。他们口出狂言，为了牟利极尽阿谀奉承之事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄姊妹，要谨记主耶稣基督的使徒从前给你们的警告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他们曾对你们说：“末世必有不敬虔、好嘲讽的人放纵自己的邪情私欲。”</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;这些人制造分裂，血气用事，心中没有圣灵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄姊妹，你们要在至圣的真道上造就自己，在圣灵的引导下祷告，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;常在上帝的爱中，等候我们主耶稣基督施怜悯赐给你们永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;那些心存疑惑的人，你们要怜悯他们；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;有些人，你们要将他们从火中抢救出来；还有些人，你们要怀着畏惧的心怜悯他们，甚至要厌恶被他们的邪情私欲玷污的衣服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10065001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "犹大书 1:24-25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "65001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24-25</sup>&nbsp;愿荣耀归给我们的救主——独一的上帝！祂能保守你们不失足犯罪，使你们无瑕无疵、欢欢喜喜地站在祂的荣耀面前。愿荣耀、威严、能力和权柄借着我们的主耶稣基督都归给祂，从万世以前直到现今，一直到永永远远。阿们！</p>"
  }
]